{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does looking up at the stars fill you with wonder? Do you want to explore the vast reaches of space, seeing what no other person ever has before? Do you wish the pinnacle of space exploration technology could be held in two hands? And do you not care about a few pesky waivers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the Shoulder-Mounted Space Program may be the right fit for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With our 99.9% acceptance rate and worryingly tolerant standards, we're sure we can fit you into our mission of exploring new areas at the edge of our galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced chaotic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic gravity simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket launchers as a mode of transportation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 unique game modes covering 16 levels</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Jump between a series of disappearing planets, trying to reach as many as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holdout: Battle enemies amongst many planets flying around and survive for as long as you can</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoulder-Mounted Space Program is a fast-paced arcade roguelike where you attempt to explore a vast region of space with only your rocket launcher. Battle robotic enemies who inhabit this region, meet wacky characters, and upgrade your equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using your rocket launcher in the realistic gravity simulation, you can launch yourself between planets, battle your foes, and collect items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join today and make your mark on the final frontier!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Glorp System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939880/8f9f942a60020d894303ddb7bfcd0466f4fdb5be.jpg"},{"name":"Refeen System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939880/d4662de9f7295985cc0fe2953c31e8e7cdd8e6ed.jpg"},{"name":"Lerato System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939880/122064fd2e19e33fc2c22e37d0109c4ea365a7a7.jpg"},{"name":"Quadrata System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939880/25364b5d2738aedb90e70482be767d13cd912427.jpg"},{"name":"Laplice System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939880/53c3e7d8c9d4dd3fbec70c697eab62c45c1a6b32.jpg"},{"name":"Secran System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939880/d06b3bfdab005abb8688bd56b6c92c6ed899ac81.jpg"},{"name":"Vismiled System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939880/ba1408e4ceef706fb6c3ac10d7f78bfac52246fd.jpg"},{"name":"Revoyan System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939880/114a23747919638efa8d477e7d73ea49016e3da1.jpg"},{"name":"Obsole System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939880/ac110b7885d0b3c7f2471bc12b6bc115f39e3cbe.jpg"},{"name":"Terilium System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3939880/105ecfaac14ccfc9800fb9e7d307afe419fa52aa.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939880?t=1766007992","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939880/9f13700d081b1c528945ef44d9d9e2e86cb57924/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766007992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939880/b99a03e29737057fded3945fdc504d23f